                <div class="w-100 position-relative">
                    <img src="~/assets/NewDesign/img/clinic/e-clinicProfile-2.jpg"  class="d-block w-100" alt="..." />
                    <div class="position-absolute  start-50 translate-middle-x    p-4 rounded-5" style="white-space: nowrap; white-space: nowrap; top: 70%; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #22060657, #070f1840); ">
                        <h2 class=" text-white fw-bold fs-1 ">What Is A Clinic Management System?</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="product-details">
                        <p class="text-muted mx-3 my-5">
                            A Clinic Management System, such as eClinic Systems, is a
                            comprehensive solution designed to manage all facets of a
                            medical clinic’s daily operations. This integrated information
                            system oversees medical, financial, administrative, legal, and
                            compliance aspects. Key functionalities include Outpatient
                            Management, Pharmacy, Radiology, Inventory, eClaim, Mobile Apps,
                            Tablet Versions, Online Scheduling, Secured Messaging, Doctor
                            and Patient Portals, Accounting, HR/Payroll, Alert Software,
                            Feedback, Biometric Integration, HL7/Integrated PACS, and
                            Business Intelligence.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-muted mx-3 my-5">
                            The implementation of a Clinic Management System enhances the
                            quality of healthcare services by streamlining various
                            processes. It helps in reducing operating costs, improving
                            revenue cycles, and managing vast sets of data such as diagnosis
                            and procedures lists, insurance companies, referring physicians,
                            and more. By enabling features like electronic health records
                            and revenue cycle management, medical facilities can efficiently
                            track patients, schedule appointments, process payments, and
                            generate essential reports, thus fostering an environment of
                            productivity and improved patient care.
                        </p>
                        <hr />
                        <div class="details-product rounded-4">
                            <h4>What Are The Benefits Of A Clinic Management System?</h4>
                            <p>
                                The Clinic Management System allows easy access to patient
                                data to generate various records, including classification
                                based on demographic, gender, age, and so on. It is especially
                                beneficial at the ambulatory point, hence enhancing continuity
                                of care. Internet-based access improves the ability to access
                                such data remotely.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                It helps as a decision support system for the medical clinic
                                authorities for developing comprehensive health care policies.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                It efficiently engenders the running of finance, the diet of
                                patients, and also the distribution of medical aid. It gives a
                                vivid picture of future clinic growth.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                It reflects an improved drug usage monitoring system,
                                including its effectiveness. It relegates adverse drug
                                interaction to the background and gives a push to appropriate
                                pharmaceutical utilization.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                Integrated Inventory Management keeps track of all clinic
                                stocks from medicines to Durable Medical Equipments and helps
                                you keep the optimum level of stock all the time. It also
                                minimizes the lost stock due to theft and misplacement.
                            </p>
                        </div>
